      "translation": "He will call on Me, and I will answer him; I will rescue him and glorify him; I will satisfy him with a long life. Whoever lives with the help of the Most High will remain under the protection of the God of heaven. Glory be to the Father, and to the Son, and to the Holy Spirit. As it was in the beginning, is now, and ever shall be, world without end. Amen. He will call on Me, and I will answer him; I will rescue him and glorify him; I will satisfy him with a long life.",
